(194, 10, 'content', '<iframe src=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/_Os7VYw_gsM?rel=0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"190\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\r\n\r\nOur main office, located across the street from the Orange County jail facility, is a family owned and operated Orange County bail bond service, and has been helping the community since 1963. We have an agent in Anaheim; ready to serve you, immediately.  For bail bonds, <a href=\"http://bail-bonds-irvine.com\">Irvine residents</a> trust our local service, as we are just minutes from all jails in the area. For immediate service with bail, <a href=\"http://huntingtonbeachbail-bonds.com\">Huntington Beach</a> residents call toll free 800-422-4540. We operate at the lowest 8% rate, and collateral is not always necessary for a bail bond. <a href=\"http://newport-beachbailbonds.com\">Newport Beach</a> , Mission Viejo, <a href=\"https://www.costa-mesabailbonds.com/\">Costa Mesa</a> and Anaheim are just a few of the county\'s cities we proudly serve. For more information on our services, please browse our services, or contact us today for quick service from our family to yours.'),
